      "translationZh": "架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f623dcce266903dd",
      "translationZh": "对于 SmolVLM，我们紧密沿用了 Idefics3 的架构，甚至在 transformers 中使用了相同的实现。不过，仍有几个关键差异：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6527e00669b7a41b",
      "translationZh": "我们用 SmolLM2 1.7B 替换了 Llama 3.1 8B，作为语言骨干模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "376330ee90bbad0c",
      "translationZh": "我们更大幅度地压缩了分块后的视觉信息，采用 pixel shuffle 策略将信息量压缩至原来的 1/9，而 idefics3 则压缩至原来的 1/4。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f16bda59a5688b8a",
      "translationZh": "我们使用 384*384 的图像块，而不是 364x364，因为 384 能被 3 整除，这是我们的像素重排策略能够奏效的必要条件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "52fef70a84fccd78",
      "translationZh": "为此，我们将视觉骨干网络改为使用经过形状优化的 SigLIP，其图像块大小为 384x384 像素，内部图像块大小为 14x14。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "442aded87a55aa8c",
      "translationZh": "性能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9f2e7732a6956e5b",
      "translationZh": "基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e151874c7f99023",
      "translationZh": "我们给出了训练细节中提到的各项任务的基准测试结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
